The Vulkan runtime of the camera HAL, taken as it is: the loader that picks
the HAL module (vulkan.tegra.so through HMI) or the system libvulkan by what
the driver offers, the entry-point table, and the device state that enables
VK_ANDROID_native_buffer, the GLSL extension and the external fence and
semaphore extensions.

From android-camera-hal (lineage-19.1), isp/vulkan/runtime at ea2c91d.
